---
// src/components/ConflictAgitation.astro
---

<section class="py-24 bg-[#070B14] text-white relative" id="conflict">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 text-red-400 text-xs font-telemetry uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        The North Texas Homeowner's Dilemma
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
        A "Free" Foundation Repair Estimate Is Often the Most Expensive Mistake in DFW.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        When a repair company inspects your home for free, their entire business model depends on finding problems they can charge $15,000 to $30,000 to fix. FSI has zero financial stake in whether your home needs repairs or not.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Side-by-Side Comparative Matrix -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Left Column: The Foundation Contractor Trap (Red Alert) -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 bg-[#0F172A]/80 border-2 border-red-500/30 shadow-xl shadow-red-950/20 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-red-500/60 transition-all">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-bl-xl bg-red-600 text-white text-[11px] font-telemetry uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">
          THE CONFLICT OF INTEREST
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6 border border-red-500/20">
            ✕
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-2">Foundation Repair Contractors</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-red-300 font-telemetry mb-6">Commissioned Sales Approach</p>

          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✕</span>
              <span><strong>Commission-Driven Quotas:</strong> Evaluators are sales reps incentivized to recommend maximum pier counts ($15,000–$35,000+).</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✕</span>
              <span><strong>Zero Engineering Liability:</strong> Not licensed by the Texas Board of Professional Engineers. No legal liability if advice causes damage.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✕</span>
              <span><strong>Arbitrary Pier Locations:</strong> "Repair bids" use generic rule-of-thumb spacing without structural engineering load calculations.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-red-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✕</span>
              <span><strong>Secondary Damage Risk:</strong> Inappropriate upward jacking can crack plumbing pipes and fracture upper-story framing.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-telemetry text-red-400">
          Result: High financial stress & potential loss of tens of thousands in unneeded work.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: The FSI Independent PE Standard (Emerald Verified) -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 bg-[#0F172A]/90 border-2 border-emerald-500/40 shadow-xl shadow-emerald-950/20 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-emerald-500/70 transition-all">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-bl-xl bg-emerald-600 text-white text-[11px] font-telemetry uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">
          THE OBJECTIVE PE STANDARD
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl mb-6 border border-emerald-500/20">
            ✓
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-2">FSI Professional Engineers</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-emerald-300 font-telemetry mb-6">Texas Board of Professional Engineers Certified</p>

          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span><strong>0% Repair Conflict:</strong> FSI does NOT sell foundation repairs. We have zero financial interest in whether you need work or not.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span><strong>State of Texas PE Stamp:</strong> Signed and sealed by a licensed Professional Engineer. Recognized by lenders, title, and city permit offices.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Digital Manometer Contours:</strong> Calibrated electronic survey maps floor levels to ±0.01", isolating true settlement from seasonal soil swelling.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold shrink-0 mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Definitive Bid-Protection:</strong> If repairs are needed, our exact CAD specifications prevent contractors from overcharging or padding bills.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs font-telemetry text-emerald-400">
          Result: Total peace of mind, objective legal protection & thousands saved.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Reality Banner -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-500/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-2xl">💡</span>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-200">
          <strong>North Texas Fact:</strong> Over 60% of homes recommended for $15,000+ piering only require drainage adjustments or seasonal moisture control.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a 
        href="#schedule" 
        class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap"
      >
        Get Objective Verification →
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
